Pose 1 (start): arm_position "out", gripper "vertical", elbow_bended false. This is a neutral pre-action pose. Pose 2 (end): arm_position "in", gripper "vertical", elbow_bended true, with high z/y values to bring the hand near the shoulder. Winner: The full motion requires transitioning from Pose 1 to Pose 2, as the action of flexing is more important than just holding the final pose.
# Q3: Structure Comparison. Compare 2+ full primitive sequences (e.g., M1: pose > movement > pose vs M2: pose > path > path). State the winner and why—**prioritize movement/path beats that express the cue**, not pose-only tweaks.
